1	# Local Development Guide
2	
3	This document provides a concise summary of how to set up a local development environment for the OpenAI SDK Knowledge MCP.
4	
5	## Table of Contents
6	- Prerequisites
7	- Installation
8	- Environment Variable Setup
9	- Database Initialization
10	- Server Startup & Build
11	- Testing & Debugging
12	- Troubleshooting
13	- Support
14	
15	## Prerequisites
16	- **Node.js**: v22 or higher
17	- **npm** (or yarn/pnpm)
18	- **OpenAI API Key** (required for embedding generation)
19	- **GitHub Token** (recommended to avoid rate limits during data collection)
20	
21	## Installation
22	```bash
23	# Clone the repository
24	git clone https://github.com/seratch/openai-sdk-knowledge-org.git
25	cd openai-sdk-knowledge-org
26	
27	# Install dependencies
28	npm install
29	```
30	
31	## Environment Variable Setup
32	1. Copy the template:
33	```bash
34	cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars
35	```
36	2. Edit `.dev.vars` and set the required values:
37	```env
38	OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxxxxx
39	GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp-xxxxxx # optional
40	GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=xxx.apps.googleusercontent.com # only if using admin features
41	GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=xxxx # only if using admin features
42	GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8787/auth/callback
43	ADMIN_EMAILS=your-email@example.com
44	JWT_SECRET=xxxx
45	DISABLE_ADMIN_AUTH_FOR_LOCAL_DEV=true # recommended for local development
46	LOG_LEVEL=debug # optional
47	```
48	
49	*Note: For Google OAuth, enabling only the People API is sufficient.*
50	
51	## Database Initialization
52	```bash
53	# Apply local DB migrations
54	npm run db:migrate:dev
55	
56	# Reset DB (if needed)
57	npm run db:reset:dev
58	```
59	
60	### Deleting Local DB Files
61	```bash
62	rm -rf .wrangler/
63	```
64	
65	### Initialize Vectorize index for dev
66	
67	```bash
68	# If you already have "openai-sdk-embeddings-dev" index, delete and then recreate it
69	npx wrangler vectorize delete openai-sdk-embeddings-dev
70	npx wrangler vectorize create openai-sdk-embeddings-dev --dimensions=1536 --metric=cosine
71	```
72	
73	## Server Startup & Build
74	```bash
75	# Start development server
76	npm run dev
77	
78	# Production build
79	npm run build
80	```
81	
82	## Troubleshooting
83	
84	- **API key not found**: Check `OPENAI_API_KEY` in `.dev.vars`
85	- **GitHub 403/rate limit**: Set `GITHUB_TOKEN`
86	- **DB connection error**: Run migrations, or delete `.wrangler/` and reinitialize
87	- **TypeScript errors**: Run `npm run build` for type checking, reinstall dependencies if needed
88	
89	## Support
90	- [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/seratch/openai-sdk-mcp-server/issues)
91	- [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/seratch/openai-sdk-mcp-server/discussions)
92	
93	---
94	
95	For more detailed procedures or operations, please refer to the various documents and the repository README.
96	

